  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and saute for another minute.",
    "Add the diced tomato and saute until the mixture is well combined.",
    "Add the sliced chili peppers and saute for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the asparagus and saute until tender.",
    "Add the fish sauce, vinegar, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
